{"title":"악의 하인","artist":"mothy","sourceId":"reference:7joJM9PZl2ewskcE92Gh","sourceHash":"da111585a9a9695b999869ae59c998381eaadb98f66b1ed95bdd8d8f6ec612b8","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":4020579,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.69,"end":4.55,"text":"君は王女 僕は召使","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.55,"end":8.64,"text":"運命分かつ 哀れな双子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":8.64,"end":12.14,"text":"君を守る その為ならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":12.14,"end":16.35,"text":"僕は悪にだってなってやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.64,"end":36.54,"text":"期待の中僕らは生まれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":36.54,"end":40.88,"text":"祝福するは教会の鐘","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":40.88,"end":44.34,"text":"大人たちの勝手な都合で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":44.34,"end":48.21,"text":"僕らの未来は二つに裂けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":48.21,"end":52.47,"text":"たとえ世界の全てが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":52.47,"end":56.42,"text":"君の敵になろうとも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":56.42,"end":60.12,"text":"僕が君を守るから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":60.12,"end":66.44,"text":"君はそこで笑っていて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":66.44,"end":70.36,"text":"君は王女 僕は召使","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":70.36,"end":74.28,"text":"運命分かつ 哀れな双子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":74.28,"end":78.19,"text":"君を守る その為ならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":78.19,"end":84.68,"text":"僕は悪にだってなってやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":84.68,"end":88.72,"text":"隣の国へ出かけたときに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":88.72,"end":92.82,"text":"街で見かけた緑のあの娘","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":92.82,"end":96.58,"text":"その優しげな声と笑顔に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":96.58,"end":100.47999999999999,"text":"一目で僕は恋に落ちました","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":100.47999999999999,"end":104.3,"text":"だけど王女があの娘のこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":104.3,"end":108.31,"text":"消してほしいと願うなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":108.31,"end":112.25999999999999,"text":"僕はそれに応えよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":112.25999999999999,"end":118.33,"text":"どうして？涙が止まらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":118.33,"end":121.97,"text":"君は王女 僕は召使","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":121.97,"end":126.12,"text":"運命分かつ 狂おしき双子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":126.12,"end":130.06,"text":"「今日のおやつはブリオッシュだよ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":130.06,"end":134.69,"text":"君は笑う 無邪気に笑う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":142.46,"end":146.48,"text":"もうすぐこの国は終わるだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":146.48,"end":150.37,"text":"怒れる国民たちの手で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":150.37,"end":154.17000000000002,"text":"これが報いだというのならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":154.17000000000002,"end":158.38,"text":"僕はあえて それに逆らおう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":158.38,"end":162.26,"text":"「ほら僕の服を貸してあげる」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":162.26,"end":166.12,"text":"「これを着てすぐお逃げなさい」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":166.12,"end":169.71,"text":"「大丈夫僕らは双子だよ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":169.71,"end":176.36,"text":"「きっとだれにもわからないさ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":176.36,"end":179.85,"text":"僕は王女 君は逃亡者","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":179.85,"end":184.39,"text":"運命分かつ 悲しき双子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":184.39,"end":188.26,"text":"君を悪だというのならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":188.26,"end":192.99,"text":"僕だって同じ 血が流れてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":192.99,"end":196.23,"text":"むかしむかしあるところに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":196.23,"end":200.38,"text":"悪逆非道の王国の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":200.38,"end":204.24,"text":"頂点に君臨してた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":204.24,"end":208.49,"text":"とても可愛い僕の姉弟","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":208.49,"end":212.25,"text":"たとえ世界の全てが (ついにその時はやってきて)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":212.25,"end":216.43,"text":"君の敵になろうとも (終わりを告げる鐘が鳴る)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":216.43,"end":220.07,"text":"僕が君を守るから (民衆などには目もくれず)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":220.07,"end":226.57999999999998,"text":"君はどこかで笑っていて (君は私の口癖を言う)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":226.57999999999998,"end":230.15,"text":"君は王女 僕は召使","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":230.15,"end":234.07,"text":"運命分かつ 哀れな双子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":234.07,"end":238.27,"text":"君を守る その為ならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":238.27,"end":242.45,"text":"僕は悪にだってなってやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":242.45,"end":245.96,"text":"もしも生まれ変われるならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":245.96,"end":251.12,"text":"その時はまた遊んでね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}